<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:
normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Thank you for your interest
in the College of Nursing and Health Innovation and the Doctor of Nursing
Practice (DNP) program at Arizona State University. We are proud that our
graduate programs rank in the top 4% nationally for best graduate nursing
programs (U.S. News &amp; World Report) and are excited that you are
considering joining us to further your nursing education.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:
normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:
normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Our DNP programs start
once per year in summer or fall, depending on specialty area. Below, you will
find important information regarding the application process. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ul type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">The admission application is available September 1<sup>st</sup>.
     <o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">The priority application deadline is December 15th.
     Applications received after this date will be reviewed on a space
     available basis.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">The GRE is not required for admission.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">A current unencumbered RN license in the state in which
     you plan to do clinical practicums is required. All students are also
     required to have an unencumbered Arizona RN license or an unencumbered
     compact state RN license as mandated by the Arizona State Board of
     Nursing. Your RN license must remain unencumbered throughout your
     enrollment in any nursing program.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">The application contains detailed instructions
     regarding your letters of recommendation, resume, goal statement, health
     and safety requirements, and admissions essay.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:
normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">We encourage you to
explore our DNP specialties&nbsp;</span><a href="https://nursingandhealth.asu.edu/degree-programs/graduate?degree_type=1" target="_blank"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">online</span></a><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;and to apply early to&nbsp;ensure you can
complete the application by the priority deadline.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:
normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:
normal"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Benefits of graduate
study at ASU include:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ul type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     line-height:normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Growing your career and lead others<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     line-height:normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Gaining broader perspectives on global health
     challenges<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     line-height:normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Surrounding yourself with expert faculty and quality
     mentors<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     line-height:normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Preparing to positively impact health outcomes<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
     line-height:normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list .5in"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
     &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Applying theory and research to advance practice<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Information regarding cost of
attendance, financial aid and scholarships is available </span><a href="https://students.asu.edu/financialaid"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">online</span></a><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;
line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:
normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;">Please do not hesitate to contact us
if you have any questions. Our team can serve as a resource throughout the
application process.&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p></div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Sincerely,</span></font><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Recruitment and Admissions</span><br style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">College of Nursing and Health Innovation</span><br style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Phone: (602) 496-0937</span><br style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Office Hours: Monday - Friday, 8 a.m. - 5 p.m.</span></font><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><a href="mailto:dnpnursing@asu.edu?Subject=Doctor%20of%20Nursing%20Practice%20Inquiry" target="_top">dnpnursing@asu.edu</a><br></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><a href="https://nursingandhealth.asu.edu"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">https://nursingandhealth.asu.edu</font></a><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" size="1" color="#cccccc">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>